@page "/system"
@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions<PhoneServerOptions> Options
@inject TftpServerService Tftp
<PageTitle>System · HomeIPhone</PageTitle><p class="eyebrow">CONTROLLER</p><h1>System</h1><section><h2>Runtime configuration</h2><dl><dt>Phone-facing URL</dt><dd>@Options.Value.BaseUrl</dd><dt>TFTP</dt><dd>@Options.Value.TftpBindAddress:@Tftp.BoundPort · @(Tftp.Bound ? "Bound" : "Not bound")</dd><dt>Poll interval</dt><dd>@Options.Value.PollIntervalSeconds seconds</dd><dt>History retention</dt><dd>@Options.Value.HistoryRetentionHours hours</dd><dt>Persistent storage</dt><dd>@Options.Value.DataPath</dd></dl><a href="/health">Health endpoint</a></section><section><h2>Network setup</h2><p>Set DHCP Option 150 to the Docker host’s LAN IP. Permit UDP/69 and TFTP transfer ports between phones and server. Allow outbound HTTP/80 to phones.</p><p class="warning">Trusted LAN only. No authentication is configured. Do not expose this application or TFTP service directly to the Internet.</p><p>SIP, SCCP, calling, paging, intercom and audio are not implemented.</p></section>
